WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:01.673
- Hup!

00:00:01.673 --> 00:00:02.506
- Hup?

00:00:02.506 --> 00:00:03.339
Is that your name?

00:00:03.339 --> 00:00:04.416
- Mm-hmm, Hup!

00:00:04.416 --> 00:00:05.249
Ha!

00:00:05.249 --> 00:00:06.082
Ah?

00:00:06.082 --> 00:00:07.629
Ooh, ha ha!

00:00:07.629 --> 00:00:08.625
(humming)

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:09.458
At ha roar!

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:11.578
Hup.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:12.411
Hup.

00:00:14.421 --> 00:00:15.340
(laughs)

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.963
- That stone in the wood.

00:00:19.571 --> 00:00:21.513
(blows raspberry)

00:00:21.513 --> 00:00:22.763
- Move podling.

00:00:24.099 --> 00:00:27.170
- The Gelfling here are all so different.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.880
- Yeah, rude.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.713
- Watch out.

00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:32.310
- Look at that ladder!

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:33.616
I wonder where it goes.

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:34.745
- [Hup] Hmm.

00:00:34.745 --> 00:00:35.578
- Oh, hi!

00:00:38.864 --> 00:00:39.697
- Huh?

00:00:40.891 --> 00:00:41.724
- Hello!

00:00:41.724 --> 00:00:43.000
- Huh?

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.893
- Deet, Hup not welcome or to be.

00:00:46.798 --> 00:00:48.906
Bleh!

00:00:48.906 --> 00:00:50.378
- Stop it, Hup.

00:00:50.378 --> 00:00:51.428
They're just curious.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:54.740
- Sail at your command

00:00:56.407 --> 00:00:58.016
(blows raspberry)

00:00:58.016 --> 00:00:59.140
- Hmm

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.295
- I don't like him either.

00:01:00.295 --> 00:01:01.250
- Huh.

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.162
- Come on, Hup. It'll be fun!

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:04.829
- [Podling Language]

00:01:06.703 --> 00:01:07.780
Hup...

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.180
want...

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.421
die!

00:01:10.421 --> 00:01:11.831
- Aww

00:01:11.831 --> 00:01:12.857
(vomits)

00:01:12.857 --> 00:01:13.927
(sighs)

00:01:13.927 --> 00:01:16.844
(sings in Podling)

00:01:17.829 --> 00:01:18.662
(bang)

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:19.830
- Quiet, podling!

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:20.710
- Huh?

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:21.543
- You'll give everyone nightmares

00:01:21.543 --> 00:01:22.683
with that wailing.

00:01:22.683 --> 00:01:25.253
- Hmph.

00:01:25.253 --> 00:01:27.592
- Ha! That ought to do it.

00:01:27.592 --> 00:01:30.175
(sings loudly)

00:01:32.151 --> 00:01:33.629
(sighs)

00:01:33.629 --> 00:01:35.330
- Podlings...

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:37.243
- Thank you, wise paladin.

00:01:37.243 --> 00:01:38.076
(kisses)

00:01:38.076 --> 00:01:38.909
- Oh!

00:01:38.909 --> 00:01:41.248
(laughs)

00:01:41.248 --> 00:01:42.961
- Agh!

00:01:42.961 --> 00:01:43.794
We go! We go!

00:01:43.794 --> 00:01:46.211
- Where did you get all that?

00:01:51.669 --> 00:01:52.502
- Ha!

00:01:52.502 --> 00:01:55.562
Mwah! (Podling)

00:01:55.562 --> 00:01:56.479
- Oh! Um...

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:58.643
How do I look?

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:01.773
- Deet always beautiful.

00:02:04.496 --> 00:02:06.663
(Podling)

00:02:07.805 --> 00:02:11.140
- Uh, (Podling)

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:11.973
- Not now, Hup!

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.290
- Is this podling in his right mind?

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.760
- He wants to be a paladin.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:19.590
- No time for ceremony now, podling.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.630
Innocent lives are at risk.

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:24.596
Stand and prove the strength of your spoon

00:02:24.596 --> 00:02:26.629
by my side.

00:02:26.629 --> 00:02:27.939
- (Podling)

00:02:27.939 --> 00:02:29.222
Hup!

00:02:29.222 --> 00:02:31.555
- (Podling)

00:02:32.629 --> 00:02:34.481
(squirts)

00:02:34.481 --> 00:02:36.233
- Whoa!

00:02:38.419 --> 00:02:39.382
Disaster!

00:02:39.382 --> 00:02:40.993
(screeches)

00:02:40.993 --> 00:02:43.190
(Podling Language)

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.190
(thuds)

00:02:46.422 --> 00:02:47.255
Whoa!

00:02:48.418 --> 00:02:49.445
(groans in pain)

00:02:49.445 --> 00:02:52.014
- There's no place in
Thra you can hide from me!

00:02:52.014 --> 00:02:52.847
- No! No!

00:02:54.594 --> 00:02:55.551
- No...

00:02:55.551 --> 00:02:56.443
Hurt...

00:02:56.443 --> 00:02:57.949
Deet!

00:02:57.949 --> 00:02:58.782
- Ah!

00:02:58.782 --> 00:03:00.609
(laughter)

00:03:00.609 --> 00:03:01.442
What?

00:03:11.525 --> 00:03:14.253
(screams)

00:03:14.253 --> 00:03:15.503
Hup! Watch out!

00:03:22.582 --> 00:03:25.749
(grunts and scuffles)

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.213
- Oh, and bring your podling slave.

00:03:30.213 --> 00:03:33.270
- He's not our slave! He's our friend.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.990
- Should run. SkekSis (Podling)

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.270
Crazy!

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:40.340
- Oh, and we'll need to borrow

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:41.544
your friend's slave.

00:03:41.544 --> 00:03:42.377
- Huh?

00:03:46.871 --> 00:03:50.530
(angry muttering)

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.447
- Wonderful

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:01.462
- In honor of Gelfling...

00:04:01.462 --> 00:04:03.045
- [Skeksis] Louder!

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.507
- In honor of Gelfling...

00:04:07.507 --> 00:04:09.507
- [Heretic] More wonder!

00:04:12.048 --> 00:04:13.965
- In honor of Gelfling!

00:04:14.835 --> 00:04:16.980
- Gah! Nevermind!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.010
[Heretic] Gah! That's enough.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.603
Thank you, thank you.

00:04:26.145 --> 00:04:27.395
- Hm!

00:04:27.395 --> 00:04:28.228
Hm!

00:04:29.268 --> 00:04:30.101
Hm! Hm!

00:04:31.401 --> 00:04:32.234
Hm!

